WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

1
00:00:00.080 --> 00:00:02.420
Kevin, when your wife was here a couple weeks ago

2
00:00:02.420 --> 00:00:03.700
we asked her a few questions

3
00:00:03.700 --> 00:00:05.130
about you and your relationship.

4
00:00:05.130 --> 00:00:08.480
And if it's okay, we want to ask you some

5
00:00:08.480 --> 00:00:10.940
of those same questions and just see

6
00:00:10.940 --> 00:00:13.892
if any of the answers match up.

7
00:00:13.892 --> 00:00:16.130
Okay. I'll give it a shot.

8
00:00:16.130 --> 00:00:17.670
All right, Kevin Bacon.

9
00:00:17.670 --> 00:00:19.011
This is your wife!

10
00:00:19.011 --> 00:00:21.418
(upbeat music)

11
00:00:21.418 --> 00:00:23.718
♪ "Here Comes the Bride" ♪

12
00:00:23.718 --> 00:00:25.650
(audience clapping)

13
00:00:25.650 --> 00:00:29.560
So, what fun is a game, you know, without a little stake?

14
00:00:29.560 --> 00:00:33.330
So Kyra says that she's gonna tell you

15
00:00:33.330 --> 00:00:35.310
what you are playing for.

16
00:00:35.310 --> 00:00:36.989
Let's take a look.

17
00:00:36.989 --> 00:00:37.822
Okay.

18
00:00:37.822 --> 00:00:41.230
So, Kev, if you get four out of five right,

19
00:00:41.230 --> 00:00:43.880
I will clean the dinner dishes for the next year,

20
00:00:43.880 --> 00:00:45.570
but, if you get them wrong

21
00:00:45.570 --> 00:00:48.548
you have to clean the dinner dishes for the next year.

22
00:00:48.548 --> 00:00:51.300
(Drew laughs)
(audience laughs)

23
00:00:51.300 --> 00:00:54.184
Wow. That's... a year?

24
00:00:54.184 --> 00:00:56.630
Wow. Okay.

25
00:00:56.630 --> 00:00:59.110
Okay. Are you ready?

26
00:00:59.110 --> 00:00:59.943
I'm ready.

27
00:00:59.943 --> 00:01:01.680
Your family has matching tattoos.

28
00:01:01.680 --> 00:01:05.191
If you got a tattoo right now, what would it be?

29
00:01:05.191 --> 00:01:07.450
Princess Kikanoke.

30
00:01:07.450 --> 00:01:09.690
Here's what Kyra said.

31
00:01:09.690 --> 00:01:11.670
If Kevin got a tattoo right now

32
00:01:11.670 --> 00:01:16.670
I think it might say "six degrees" for his sixdegrees.org.

33
00:01:18.970 --> 00:01:21.450
Not for the reason everybody will think it will be,

34
00:01:21.450 --> 00:01:24.137
but for the sixdegrees.org.

35
00:01:24.137 --> 00:01:24.970
(fail buzzer sound)

36
00:01:24.970 --> 00:01:25.803
Oh well.

37
00:01:25.803 --> 00:01:26.910
Uh oh.
(audience laughs)

38
00:01:26.910 --> 00:01:28.440
Look, I'm gonna be doing some dishes.

39
00:01:28.440 --> 00:01:29.273
Okay.

40
00:01:29.273 --> 00:01:31.700
What is something of yours

41
00:01:31.700 --> 00:01:34.653
that Kyra would just love for you to get rid of?

42
00:01:35.970 --> 00:01:37.435
Something I would love to get rid of?

43
00:01:37.435 --> 00:01:39.663
Maybe an old pair of sneakers.

44
00:01:40.780 --> 00:01:43.420
Eurgh. Here's what she said.

45
00:01:43.420 --> 00:01:48.055
The thing I would like Kevin to get rid of

46
00:01:48.055 --> 00:01:50.540
is some of his t-shirts.

47
00:01:50.540 --> 00:01:54.269
I'm a big fan of him in collared shirts.

48
00:01:54.269 --> 00:01:55.102
(fail buzzer sound)

49
00:01:55.102 --> 00:01:58.600
Yeah. She made me put on a collared shirt today. Yeah.

50
00:01:58.600 --> 00:02:01.480
Cute. Okay. What's one thing of Kyra's

51
00:02:01.480 --> 00:02:03.923
that you would love to throw out?

52
00:02:05.120 --> 00:02:09.156
Oh, I would say all of her earrings.

53
00:02:09.156 --> 00:02:10.950
I have an earring phobia.

54
00:02:10.950 --> 00:02:13.000
I really don't like earrings.

55
00:02:13.000 --> 00:02:14.688
Well, here's what Kyra said.

56
00:02:14.688 --> 00:02:17.060
I know I'm gonna be right about this one.

57
00:02:17.060 --> 00:02:20.570
The things of mine that Kevin would like me to get rid of

58
00:02:20.570 --> 00:02:22.740
are all my earrings.

59
00:02:22.740 --> 00:02:23.764
Not a fan of earrings.

60
00:02:23.764 --> 00:02:27.300
(audience claps and cheers)

61
00:02:27.300 --> 00:02:28.710
Okay. If you could eat one meal

62
00:02:28.710 --> 00:02:31.270
for the rest of your life, what would it be?

63
00:02:31.270 --> 00:02:32.720
Pizza.

64
00:02:32.720 --> 00:02:34.340
Uh huh. Okay.

65
00:02:34.340 --> 00:02:35.623
Here's what Kyra said.

66
00:02:36.550 --> 00:02:39.630
If Kevin had to eat one meal for the rest of his life

67
00:02:39.630 --> 00:02:44.630
I think it would be something like a fish taco.

68
00:02:45.399 --> 00:02:46.232
(fail buzzer sound)

69
00:02:46.232 --> 00:02:47.898
(Drew laughs)
(audience laughs)

70
00:02:47.898 --> 00:02:49.103
You know... she's actually right.

71
00:02:49.103 --> 00:02:52.155
She knows you better than you know yourself, right?

72
00:02:52.155 --> 00:02:54.430
She knows me better than I know myself.

73
00:02:54.430 --> 00:02:55.450
Okay. Last question.

74
00:02:55.450 --> 00:02:57.313
Which goat is your favorite goat?

75
00:02:58.166 --> 00:03:00.630
Well, I hate to play favorites

76
00:03:00.630 --> 00:03:04.910
but Macon is... Macon Bacon is pretty irresistible.

77
00:03:04.910 --> 00:03:06.200
Here's what she said.

78
00:03:06.200 --> 00:03:08.882
Kevin's favorite goat is Macon.

79
00:03:08.882 --> 00:03:10.705
Shh! Don't tell Louis.

80
00:03:10.705 --> 00:03:11.809
(Kevin laughs)
(audience laughs)

81
00:03:11.809 --> 00:03:12.642
(high pitched bell rings)

82
00:03:12.642 --> 00:03:15.200
We might be getting dirty with those dishes later.

83
00:03:15.200 --> 00:03:16.880
And I thank you so much, Kevin Bacon,

84
00:03:16.880 --> 00:03:18.020
for coming on the show today.

85
00:03:18.020 --> 00:03:19.300
Really. Thank you.

86
00:03:19.300 --> 00:03:20.710
(audience claps)
Thanks for having me, Drew

87
00:03:20.710 --> 00:03:23.460
I'm a big fan and it's fantastic what you're doing

88
00:03:23.460 --> 00:03:25.390
and keep up the great work.

89
00:03:25.390 --> 00:03:26.664
Well, thank you.

90
00:03:26.664 --> 00:03:30.380
City on a Hill airs Sundays on Showtime

91
00:03:30.380 --> 00:03:33.230
at 9:00 pm Eastern and Pacific.

92
00:03:33.230 --> 00:03:35.470
Say hi to Kyra for me.

93
00:03:35.470 --> 00:03:36.580
Will do.

94
00:03:36.580 --> 00:03:39.663
(upbeat outro music)

